template.text:
You triage customer support tickets.

The ticket, as JSON:
{ticket}

Classify it. The category is exactly one of: billing (charges, refunds, invoices, plans), technical (errors, bugs, outages, integrations), account (signing in, passwords, profile, access, deletion) or other. The urgency is low, normal or high: high when the customer cannot work at all, is losing money, or reports a security problem. Reply with one JSON object and no other text:

{{"category": "billing", "urgency": "normal", "summary": "<one sentence>"}}
